WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.040
When someone passes away and leaves behind a home, figuring out what happens next isn't always simple.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:14.160
Who owns the property? Does probate need to be opened? What happens if there's no will

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:21.440
or family members disagree? At Pages of Purpose LLC, we specialize in complicated inherited

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:26.800
property situations. We research ownership and title issues, help coordinate with appropriate

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.000
legal professionals, and explore options for families who may want to sell. Even if probate

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.840
hasn't started, you can reach out to discuss your situation. No pressure, no obligation,

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:44.880
just a conversation about your options. Visit pagesofpurposellc.com to learn more.
